WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:06.810
Hi, I'm Fred Noseit, the keeper of AIEDUME and your 6 to 8 teacher helper.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:12.520
Ask me anything and I'll find it for you or send you to the right helper.

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:18.360
